{"id":"G1793","lema":"ἐντυγχάνω","lemaStrong":"ἐντυγχάνω","translit":"entynchánō","pron":"","glosa":"intercede","defStrong":"to chance upon, i.e. (by implication) confer with; by extension to entreat (in favor or against)","defKjv":"deal with, make intercession","derivacion":"from G1722 (ἐν) and G5177 (τυγχάνω);","veces":5,"versos":5,"refs":["Hch 25:24","Ro 8:27","Ro 8:34","Ro 11:2","He 7:25"],"texto":"Textus Receptus (Scrivener 1894)"}